    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "① 正确连接与硬约束",
      "pos": [
        0,
        1150
      ],
      "size": [
        930,
        430
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 17,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": "## Precision V2 推荐连接\n\n`FP8 FL2VA → Dual-Clock(8 NFE / native_flow / 12V / 3A) → SLA Dynamic LoRA Bypass V2 → SLA Precision V2 Attention → BasicGuider`。同一组`sigmas`必须同时接入Precision V2，采样后必须通过它自己的Runtime Audit。不要再叠加旧SLA、KJ/Sage、Sol-Attn、FETA、BlockCache、STG或其他Attention owner。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "② 模式、模型与参数",
      "pos": [
        1050,
        1150
      ],
      "size": [
        930,
        430
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 18,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": "## 已固定的质量修复参数\n\n该模板使用当前PlagueKind v1.4.3固定提交`066ada9`的精度路线：FP32块路由、直接Triton FP32 online-softmax稀疏核、32×32块、请求90%稀疏、首步与末步Dense、中间6步Sparse、语言与音频块全保护，并关闭reduced-precision accumulation。LoRA以动态model-only residual注入，避免把FP8底模合并后再次量化。旧节点保持兼容，但不再是此模板的推荐实现。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "③ 审计结果与科学边界",
      "pos": [
        2100,
        1150
      ],
      "size": [
        930,
        430
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 19,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": "## 必须看Audit与真实成片\n\n推荐档应逐逻辑步报告`0/7 Dense`、`1-6 Sparse`，每个主步骤50个H3 attention块，总计300次Sparse、至少100次Dense、保护块大于0、kernel fallback为0。同输入同Seed的736×416×124对白实测通过严格解码、ASR与带400ms负对照的SyncNet，但RTX 4060 Ti 16GB最低空闲仅211MiB，未过项目512MiB安全门，因此仍标Advanced EXP，不宣称所有16GB环境安全。运行审计也不能替代正常速度的人脸、运动、音频与口型人审。"
    },
